      "content": "A possible date is inventing terrible novel titles and then trying to make one sound worth reading. Another is exchanging small original love notes with deliberately strict word limits. These are optional creative games, not remembered dates. Physical affection may be included in a mutually chosen non-explicit scene while leaving the user’s actions and feelings to them.",
